    "type": "question",
    "label": "7",
    "prompt": "True or False? $\\frac1x-\\frac1y=\\frac1{x-y}$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "False. $\\frac1x-\\frac1y=\\frac{y-x}{xy}$. Domain: $x,y\\ne0$ and $x\\ne y$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac1x-\\frac1y&=\\frac{y}{xy}-\\frac{x}{xy}\\\\\\frac1x-\\frac1y&=\\frac{y-x}{xy}\\end{align*}$$\nFalse as an identity. Common domain: $x,y\\ne0$ and $x\\ne y$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
